content='<think>\nAlright, I need to fix the Ansible Playbook so that it passes ansible-lint. Let me look at the error messages and figure out what\'s wrong.\n\nFirst, the errors mention using FQCN for certain modules. I remember that FQCN stands for Fully Qualified Controller Name. So, instead of using the short names like `import_tasks`, `apt`, `template`, `service`, I should use their FQCNs.\n\nLooking at the first task, it\'s using `import_tasks: tasks/assert.yml`. The error says to use `ansible.builtin.import_tasks` instead. So I\'ll replace that.\n\nNext, the `apt` module is used without a namespace. The error suggests using `ansible.builtin.apt` or `ansible.legacy.apt`. Since I\'m using the builtin, I\'ll change it to `ansible.builtin.apt`.\n\nSimilarly, for the `template` module, I\'ll replace it with `ansible.builtin.template`.\n\nThen, the `service` module also needs the FQCN, so I\'ll change it to `ansible.builtin.service`.\n\nAnother error is about the key order in tasks. Ansible-lint prefers the order name first, then other keys. So, for each task, I\'ll make sure that `name` comes first.\n\nThere\'s also an issue with the octal value "0644". Ansible-lint doesn\'t like implicit octal values. I should convert it to decimal. 0644 in octal is 420 in decimal. So I\'ll change `mode: 0644` to `mode: 420`.\n\nNow, I\'ll go through each task and make these changes:\n\n1. The import_tasks line: Change to `ansible.builtin.import_tasks`.\n2. The apt module: Replace with `ansible.builtin.apt`.\n3. The template module: Use `ansible.builtin.template`.\n4. The service module: Use `ansible.builtin.service`.\n5. Fix the mode value to 420.\n\nI\'ll also ensure that in each task, the `name` key is the first one, followed by the module parameters.\n\nLet me reconstruct the tasks accordingly. That should fix all the linting issues without changing the functionality.\n</think>\n\n---\n- ansible.builtin.import_tasks:\n    path: tasks/assert.yml\n  name: Import assert.yml\n\n- ansible.builtin.apt:\n    name: vsftpd\n    state: present\n  name: Install vsftpd\n\n- ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: vsftpd.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/vsftpd.conf\n    owner: root\n    group: root\n    mode: 420\n    notify: vsftpd-restart\n  name: Configure vsftpd\n\n- ansible.builtin.service:\n    name: vsftpd\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n  name: Start and enable vsftpd' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-08T05:00:45.875528715Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 14530257310, 'load_duration': 79324147, 'prompt_eval_count': 2488, 'prompt_eval_duration': 1560778243, 'eval_count': 613, 'eval_duration': 12888081503, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--3af4801b-d5b9-4693-b931-56374c00282b-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2488, 'output_tokens': 613, 'total_tokens': 3101}
