Task 2: Rename python3.11 EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file if it exists
Description Task 2: Rename the EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file to EXTERNALLY-MANAGED.old if it exists in the python3.11 directory.

Task 3: Check if python3.12 EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file exists
Description Task 3: Verify the existence of the EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file in the python3.12 directory.

Task 4: Rename python3.12 EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file if it exists
Description Task 4: Rename the EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file to EXTERNALLY-MANAGED.old if it exists in the python3.12 directory.

Task 5: Import assert.yml
Description Task 5: Import tasks from assert.yml file on the localhost.

Task 6: Install python pip
Description Task 6: Install python pip packages specified in the variable python_pip_packages.

Task 7: Configure pip proxy
Description Task 7: Configure the pip proxy in /etc/pip.conf if the variable python_pip_proxy is defined.

Task 8: Trust hosts
Description Task 8: Set trusted hosts in /etc/pip.conf if the variable python_pip_trusted_host is defined.

Task 9: Update pip.
Description Task 9: Update pip using the specified parameters if the variable python_pip_update is true and the OS is not bookworm or noble, and is not Alpine.

Task 10: Install requested modules
Description Task 10: Install specified pip modules defined in python_pip_modules if the OS is not bookworm or noble, and is not Alpine.


- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- name: Check if python3.11 EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file exists
  file:
    path: /usr/lib/python3.11/EXTERNALLY-MANAGED
    state: absent
    check: yes

- name: Rename python3.11 EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file if it exists
  file:
    path: /usr/lib/python3.11/EXTERNALLY-MANAGED.old
    state: renamed
    src: /usr/lib/python3.11/EXTERNALLY-MANAGED

- name: Check if python3.12 EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file exists
  file:
    path: /usr/lib/python3.12/EXTERNALLY-MANAGED
    state: absent
    check: yes

- name: Rename python3.12 EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file if it exists
  file:
    path: /usr/lib/python3.12/EXTERNALLY-MANAGED.old
    state: renamed
    src: /usr/lib/python3.12/EXTERNALLY-MANAGED

- name: Import assert.yml
  import_tasks: assert.yml
  host: localhost

- name: Install python pip
  apt:
    name: "{{ python_pip_packages }}"
    state: present

- name: Configure pip proxy
  template:
    src: pip.conf.j2
    dest: /etc/pip.conf
    mode: 0644
  when: ansible_var(python_pip_proxy) is defined

- name: Trust hosts
  template:
    src: pip.conf.j2
    dest: /etc/pip.conf
    mode: 0644
  when: ansible_var(python_pip_trusted_host) is defined

- name: Update pip
  pip:
    requirements: "{{ python_pip_update | default('yes') | lower }}=yes"
    state: latest
  when:
    - ansible_os_family is not "Debian" or
      ansible_distribution not in ["bookworm", "noble", "Alpine"]

- name: Install requested modules
  pip:
    requirements: "{{ python_pip_modules | join(',') }}"
    state: present
  when:
    - ansible_os_family is not "Debian" or
      ansible_distribution not in ["bookworm", "noble", "Alpine"]



