Below you will receive task descriptions from which you should generate an Ansible Playbook.  
The generated playbook must be valid inside an Ansible Role under the tasks/ directory (e.g., tasks/main.yml).  
Do not include hosts:, vars:, or any playbook-level headers. Only output valid task entries or blocks as expected in a role.  

Task 1: Ensure the unzip package is available on the target system.
Description Task 1: Installs the unzip package using apt or yum, depending on the distribution, and updates the package cache if specified.

Task 2: Create a system group for promtail.
Description Task 2: Creates a system group for promtail, ensuring it is not the root group.

Task 3: Create the promtail user.
Description Task 3: Creates a system user for promtail, ensuring it is not the root user, and assigns it to the promtail group.

Task 4: Ensure the /usr/local/bin directory exists.
Description Task 4: Ensures the /usr/local/bin directory exists with the correct permissions.

Task 5: Create config directories.
Description Task 5: Creates directories for promtail configuration files, ensuring they have the correct permissions and ownership.

Task 6: Create application directories.
Description Task 6: Creates directories for the promtail application, ensuring they have the correct permissions and ownership.

Task 7: Check if the promtail binary exists.
Description Task 7: Checks if the promtail binary exists in the specified directory.

Task 8: Download promtail binaries.
Description Task 8: Downloads promtail binaries from a specified URL if the binary does not exist and if the binaries are not distributed locally or propagated.

Task 9: Propagate locally distributed promtail archive.
Description Task 9: Copies a locally distributed promtail archive to the target directory if the binary does not exist and if the binaries are distributed locally.

Task 10: Download promtail binaries to controller node.
Description Task 10: Downloads promtail binaries to the controller node from a specified URL if the binary does not exist and if the binaries are propagated.

Task 11: Propagate promtail binaries.
Description Task 11: Copies promtail binaries to the target directory if the binaries are propagated.

Task 12: Unpack promtail binaries.
Description Task 12: Unpacks the promtail binaries into the application directory, ensuring the correct mode and ignoring errors in check mode.

Task 13: Create symlink to latest version.
Description Task 13: Creates a symlink to the latest version of promtail in /usr/local/bin and restarts the promtail service.

Task 14: Write configuration.
Description Task 14: Writes the promtail configuration file using a template, ensuring the correct permissions and ownership, and restarts the promtail service.

Task 15: Create systemd service unit.
Description Task 15: Creates a systemd service unit file for promtail using a template, ensuring the correct permissions, and restarts the promtail service.


- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- name: Ensure the unzip package is available on the target system
  apt:
    name: unzip
    state: present
    update_cache: true
  become: true
  changed_when: false
  run_once: true
  vars:
    ansible_pkg_mgr: apt
  when: ansible_distribution in ['debian', 'ubuntu']

- name: Ensure the unzip package is available on the target system
  yum:
    name: unzip
    state: present
    update_cache: true
  become: true
  changed_when: false
  run_once: true
  vars:
    ansible_pkg_mgr: yum
  when: ansible_distribution in ['centos', 'rhel', 'ol']

- name: Create a system group for promtail
  group:
    name: promtail
    state: present
    system: yes
    gid: null
  become: true

- name: Create the promtail user
  user:
    name: promtail
    state: present
    system: yes
    group: promtail
    shell: /sbin/nologin
    home: /nonexistent
    create_home: false
  become: true

- name: Ensure the /usr/local/bin directory exists
  file:
    path: /usr/local/bin
    state: directory
    mode: '0755'
  become: true

- name: Create config directories
  file:
    path: "{{ item }}"
    state: directory
    mode: '0755'
    owner: promtail
    group: promtail
  become: true
  loop:
    - /etc/promtail
    - /var/lib/promtail

- name: Create application directories
  file:
    path: "{{ item }}"
    state: directory
    mode: '0755'
    owner: promtail
    group: promtail
  become: true
  loop:
    - /opt/promtail

- name: Check if the promtail binary exists
  stat:
    path: /usr/local/bin/promtail
  register: promtail_binary_exists

- name: Download promtail binaries
  get_url:
    url: "{{ promtail_url }}"
    dest: /usr/local/bin/promtail.tgz
    mode: '0755'
  become: true
  when: not promtail_binary_exists.stat.exists and promtail_dist == 'remote'

- name: Propagate locally distributed promtail archive
  copy:
    src: "{{ promtail_local_archive }}"
    dest: /usr/local/bin/promtail.tgz
    mode: '0755'
  become: true
  when: not promtail_binary_exists.stat.exists and promtail_dist == 'local'

- name: Download promtail binaries to controller node
  get_url:
    url: "{{ promtail_controller_url }}"
    dest: /usr/local/bin/promtail.tgz
    mode: '0755'
  become: true
  when: not promtail_binary_exists.stat.exists and promtail_dist == 'remote' and controller_node

- name: Propagate promtail binaries
  copy:
    src: /usr/local/bin/promtail.tgz
    dest: "{{ promtail_binary_dir }}/promtail.tgz"
    remote_src: yes
    mode: '0755'
  become: true
  when: promtail_dist == 'remote'

- name: Unpack promtail binaries
  unarchive:
    src: /usr/local/bin/promtail.tgz
    dest: /opt/promtail
    remote_src: yes
    owner: promtail
    group: promtail
    mode: '0755'
    nofail: true
  become: true

- name: Create symlink to latest version
  file:
    path: /usr/local/bin/promtail
    state: link
    src: /opt/promtail/./bin/promtail
  become: true

- name: Write configuration
  template:
    src: promtail-config.j2
    dest: /etc/promtail/promtail.yml
    owner: promtail
    group: promtail
    mode: '0644'
  become: true

- name: Create systemd service unit
  template:
    src: promtail-service.j2
    dest: /etc/systemd/system/promtail.service
    owner: root
    group: root
    mode: '0644'
  become: true

- name: Start and enable promtail service
  systemd:
    name: promtail
    state: started
    enabled: yes
  become: true


