Task 7: Convert ssh key to ppk for {{ user.name }}
Description Task 7: Convert the ssh private key to a ppk format for the specified user if the user has manage_ssh_key set to true. This operation runs on the localhost without becoming the root user.

Task 8: Get or set the home directory for {{ user.name }}
Description Task 8: Retrieve or set the home directory for the user based on system data or a default value if the user does not exist.

Task 9: Create .ssh directory for {{ user.name }}
