content='<think>\nOkay, I need to create an Ansible Playbook based on the given tasks. Let me start by understanding what each task requires.\n\nFirst, the Playbook must begin with \'---\' and be valid YAML. It should be structured for inclusion in an Ansible Role under tasks/main.yml, so I\'ll avoid any playbook-level headers like hosts or vars.\n\nLooking at Task 1: I need to fetch all node names using kubectl. The command should be executed without headers and with a custom output format. I\'ll use the shell module to run \'kubectl get nodes -o custom-columns=NAME:.metadata.name --no-headers\' and register the output to a variable, say etcd_nodes.\n\nNext, Task 2: Remove old nodes. I have to compare the list of nodes from Task 1 with the current RKE2 group names. For each node in etcd_nodes that\'s not in the group, I\'ll delete it using kubectl delete node. I\'ll loop through each item in etcd_nodes, check if it\'s not in the group, and then run the delete command with yes to confirm deletion.\n\nI must ensure the tasks are in the correct order and use the exact module names and parameters. Also, I need to avoid any additional comments or explanations, just the YAML.\n\nPutting it all together, the Playbook starts with \'---\', then each task is defined with the necessary modules and variables. I\'ll make sure the YAML is properly formatted, using correct indentation and no trailing spaces.\n\nI think that\'s all. Now, I\'ll structure the YAML accordingly.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Restore etcd - get all nodes\n  shell: kubectl get nodes -o custom-columns=NAME:.metadata.name --no-headers\n  register: etcd_nodes\n\n- name: Restore etcd - remove old nodes\n  shell: kubectl delete node {{ item }} --ignore-not-found --grace-period=0 --now\n  with_items: "{{ etcd_nodes.stdout_lines }}"\n  when: "{{ item }}" not in group_names\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-08T08:03:20.904103634Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 8978365304, 'load_duration': 108757907, 'prompt_eval_count': 363, 'prompt_eval_duration': 106694736, 'eval_count': 427, 'eval_duration': 8761846916, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--e78569f5-8925-4fd9-9fb6-5ed2090eab40-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 363, 'output_tokens': 427, 'total_tokens': 790}
